WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.935
Day one is a check, not a lesson.

2
00:00:02.385 --> 00:00:03.949
It shows you where the mix-up is.

3
00:00:04.649 --> 00:00:08.880
You hold the grown-up page. Your child gets the page with the big letters.

4
00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:10.509
There are three parts.

5
00:00:10.959 --> 00:00:15.437
Part A. Point to each letter on your child's page. Your child says its sound.

6
00:00:15.887 --> 00:00:18.184
You are listening for the sound. Like this.

7
00:00:20.546 --> 00:00:25.918
Part B. Now you say a sound, and your child writes the letter. Your page shows you the order.

8
00:00:26.368 --> 00:00:28.965
Part C. Your child reads the six words.

9
00:00:29.415 --> 00:00:33.087
Do not teach, and do not correct today. Just listen and mark.

10
00:00:33.537 --> 00:00:39.254
Then read the yellow box at the bottom of your page, from the top. Stop at the first line that fits.

11
00:00:39.704 --> 00:00:45.210
That line tells you whether the mix-up is in reading, in writing, or both, and which days to do.

12
00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:50.338
Write the three numbers on the page, and keep it. You will look at it again on the last day.
